/-! ## 5. The T2 terminal

`V` and `G` are the **literal** brackets of `Pt.JTop.value` / `Box.JTop.part i`
(proved equal to the tree slots in `V_mem`/`G_mem`), so the slack below is one
pure-integer kernel computation: `Nat.sqrt` inside the tree never reaches it. -/

def V : DC := ⟨(208 : ℤ), (587393582196002218032847246998856582955971040907244428801872 : ℤ), (587442674310634486484445880603749657865493050474998010309257 : ℤ)⟩

def G : Fin 3 → DC
  | 0 => ⟨(205 : ℤ), (124480329847745442985479263690634943063879712386864585683110 : ℤ), (1023132507086289928126980731757244993492210732807457355939831 : ℤ)⟩
